  StyleBox["rule", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "6e3ffe37-5807-bb49-b33d-8ed8d3407d7d"],
 " on a finite tape.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo", ExpressionUUID->
  "3693dcb1-61a5-d94d-8e69-4b0a1f504623"],
 Cell[BoxData[
